{
    "id": "zmvla7av3iohil20",
    "label": "12312312312312312",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "MUV bridge flow for CompuLab IFM-DI8O8 (MUV Edge Ultra), via gpiod on /dev/iotdin/extension/DI8O8-<slot>-gpiochip.\nTab label must be the bridge id.\n\nProtocol data point convention:\n- io: \"DI\" (default) or \"DO\"\n- address: pin 0..7\n- invert: optional boolean\n- slot: optional per data point, otherwise controller.slot (default \"A\")\n\nInputs are polled with gpioget. Outputs are written only via commands (gpioset);\ntheir metric reflects the last successful command, outputs are never read back.",
    "env": [
        {
            "name": "DI_LINE_OFFSET",
            "value": "0",
            "type": "num"
        },
        {
            "name": "DO_LINE_OFFSET",
            "value": "8",
            "type": "num"
        },
